  This will happen a lot on an ascension run.  You need to
know how to handle it.  

  - Engrave Elbereth (fingers, athame, disposable blades, 
      wands of digging, fire, or lightning)
  - Drop a scroll of scare monster
  - cast cause fear
  - read a scroll of scare monster (dropping is much better)
  - cast charm monster
  - zap a wand of digging down
  - break a wand of teleport
  - teleport yourself away (wand, ring, scroll)
    - Ctrl-T while wearing a ring of teleport will teleport 
      you.
  - zap a wand of teleport in the direction you want to go
  - Once you have a way clear by one of the above methods, 
       - #jump (spell, boots, knight) away!
       - Make yourself invisible (wand, potion, cape, ring)
         or displaced & "Run away, run away!"


